	(text "+5VOUT is drawn twice: D2 feeds it from the boost, and SW2 takes it (or +5VIN) for the Grove port. Q2 and Q3, back to back, pass the cell to VBAT_IN as SW1 sets Q3's gate (Q2's is on GND); Q1 passes VBAT_IN to VBAT_OUT, its gate held by the CN809J U3 that watches +5VIN. The module's U104 and the carrier's U4 both drive +3.3V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 135.48 0)
		(effects
